        "@value": "{\"action\":\"meet\",\"actor\":\"The permittee conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"on natural slopes that exceed 20 degrees\",\"on lesser slopes that require measures to protect the area from disturbance, as determined by the regulatory authority after consideration of soils, climate, the method of operation, geology, and other regional characteristics\"],\"choice_text\":\"on natural slopes exceeding 20 degrees OR on lesser slopes requiring protective measures as determined by the regulatory authority\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"on natural slopes that exceed 20 degrees, or on lesser slopes that require measures to protect the area from disturbance, as determined by the regulatory authority after consideration of soils, climate, the method of operation, geology, and other regional characteristics\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"object\":\"the following performance standards\",\"scope_text\":\"Applies to permittees conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations on natural slopes exceeding 20 degrees, or on lesser slopes requiring measures to protect the area from disturbance as determined by the regulatory authority after considering soils, climate, operation method, geology, and other regional characteristics.\",\"summary\":\"Permittees conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations on natural slopes over 20 degrees or specified lesser slopes must meet the performance standards of this section.\"}",
