 other regional characteristics\",\"choice_text\":\"on natural slopes exceeding 20 degrees OR on lesser slopes requiring protective measures as determined by the regulatory authority\",\"context_quotes\":[],\"end\":392,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":392,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:0:392:sha256-9afce8cab4fa0be3a73a3ca1fafe0da545a5e86f1904605d24ab51c42d4589cb\",\"quote\":\"The permittee conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations on natural slopes that exceed 20 degrees, or on lesser slopes that require measures to protect the area from disturbance, as determined by the regulatory authority after consideration of soils, climate, the method of operation, geology, and other regional characteristics, shall meet the following performance standards.\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":71,\"field\":\"actor\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:0:71:sha256-dfe68b2d06b18fda7d814e045e09b428feee5767d757d9c8ef4fd1c145199eab\",\"quote\":\"The permittee conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":355,\"field\":\"action\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:345:355:sha256-1e902f422605b6c5d35c35fd032879c55637e60f9e095d4f685f08e4ece5f321\",\"quote\":\"shall meet\",\"start\":345},{\"end\":391,\"field\":\"object\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:356:391:sha256-f9cf87d89309ee3060c871846863d9b5d160633e88446f8b9f98ee2d51cc3db3\",\"quote\":\"the following performance standards\",\"start\":356},{\"end\":343,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:frag