e conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":808,\"field\":\"action\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:768:808:sha256-0e41aedbe72801b5ee932bc0ae733ac508a058d766e63af161afd8b3ac0af309\",\"quote\":\"shall not be placed or allowed to remain\",\"start\":768},{\"end\":766,\"field\":\"object\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:654:766:sha256-ccca1bc8beb393914e25dec460783c8e155a9da4c847aa429f87894074a56e92\",\"quote\":\"Spoil, waste materials or debris, including that from clearing and grubbing, and abandoned or disabled equipment\",\"start\":654},{\"end\":826,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:654:826:sha256-eac12a27c43bab33a998811f9eadcebf6e2759cbdc593a364fbc079b108a31d7\",\"quote\":\"Spoil, waste materials or debris, including that from clearing and grubbing, and abandoned or disabled equipment, shall not be placed or allowed to remain on the downslope.\",\"start\":654},{\"end\":777,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:768:777:sha256-28a543410ef33838c223aa24fd725afc191e2cefa8bed95abc857ae6ff33f86e\",\"quote\":\"shall not\",\"start\":768},{\"end\":392,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A2121d7a65944c6bcd169c568eaf6ab38642f378ca63195763b375de54c91c10c:0:392:sha256-9afce8cab4fa0be3a73a3ca1fafe0da545a5e86f1904605d24ab51c42d4589cb\",\"quote\":\"The permittee conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations on natural slopes that exceed 20 degrees, or on lesser slopes that require measures to protect the area from disturbance, as determined by the regulatory authority after consideration of soils, climate, the method of operation, geology, and other regional characteristics, shall meet the following performance standards.\",\"start\":0}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:779720031cb01398bb6eb4600fe8dccbde582ce36194722188ffd30aa0af38db\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"Spoil, waste materials or debris, including that from clearing and grubbing, and abandoned or disabled equipment, shall not be placed or allowed to remain on the downslope.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c677717d2252a41572fd0d9b681f3cd763893a89016fa366e02a108d20c1ba05\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall not\",\"object\":\"Spoil, waste materials or debris, including that from clearing and grubbing, and abandoned or disabled equipment, on the downslope\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:8bc24d39def26716dc9bebd3cea4e3c81e18e0060f8715be2c6c777738cd036d\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"Spoil, waste materials or debris, including that from clearing and grubbing, and abandoned or disabled equipment, shall not be placed or allowed to remain on the downslope.\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:a079edb504bc3f1a2e5d269ad620503869b8aa607a576eea0dacc81d8a5ae0fa\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"The permittee conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations on natural slopes that exceed 20 degrees, or on lesser slopes that require measures to protect the area from disturbance, as determined by the regulatory authority after consideration of soils, climate, the method of operation, geology, and other regional characteristics, shall meet the following performance standards.\"],\"scope_text\":\"Governed by steep slope operations under this section, where mining is not on flat/gently rolling terrain leaving a flat area and not governed by § 716.3.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":654,\"summary\":\"Spoil, waste materials or debris (including clearing and grubbing debris), and abandoned or disabled equipment must not be placed or allowed to remain on the downslope.\",\"target_ids\":[]}",
