on operations on natural slopes that exceed 20 degrees, or on lesser slopes that require measures to protect the area from disturbance, as determined by the regulatory authority after consideration of soils, climate, the method of operation, geology, and other regional characteristics, shall meet the following performance standards.\",\"start\":0}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:992cd075951446925ad1a4f7847d121c79d8a42b95c8221d4299f92958e2e3e0\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"Material in excess of that required to meet the provisions of § 715.14 of this chapter shall be disposed of in accordance with the requirements of § 715.15 of this chapter.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:0723bc8a90606817d75454e21500852bfe49b0c1b6da0a88cf8b9344dd6d8dbe\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"Material in excess of that required to meet the provisions of § 715.14 of this chapter\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:e32d738e185f8374f84065d4be5c6188c214e924c3135c0db3dd14a6f68b67fb\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"Material in excess of that required to meet the provisions of § 715.14 of this chapter shall be disposed of in accordance with the requirements of § 715.15 of this chapter.\",\"references\":[\"§ 715.14\",\"§ 715.15\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:ac5725ffab8a7880f48cd397d7742c7b9448e820272961c7188663d60be71b45\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"The permittee conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations on natural slopes that exceed 20 degrees, or on lesser slopes that require measures to protect the area from disturbance, as determined by the regulatory authority after consideration of soils, climate, the method of operation, geology, and other regional characteristics, shall meet the following performance standards.\"],\"scope_text\":\"Governed by steep slope operations under this section, where mining is not on flat/gently rolling terrain leaving a flat area and not governed by § 716.3.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1151,\"summary\":\"Material exceeding what is required to comply with § 715.14 must be disposed of according to § 715.15.\",\"target_ids\":[]}",
