peration, geology, and other regional characteristics, shall meet the following performance standards.\",\"start\":0}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:87b44f60e967a0f6af4d051e2db5c4e7b4c38e14dc102b07172c10f9efe2f86c\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"Woody materials may be chipped and distributed through the backfill when approved by the regulatory authority.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:2060ee7d6af20df00b5603f67d072318a32a3aa08abd9e64088feddc21a78e28\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"modality_quote\":\"may\",\"object\":\"Woody materials\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:07a96ef0f4fa185f265d8a20bff0cf6d88a2263a62550a3b4b903bbbb731cd82\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"Woody materials may be chipped and distributed through the backfill when approved by the regulatory authority.\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:b5d3fd1c91088e539feb3143b50b94cf069b23e4a52a360fc2843ed639b9e744\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"The permittee conducting surface coal mining and reclamation operations on natural slopes that exceed 20 degrees, or on lesser slopes that require measures to protect the area from disturbance, as determined by the regulatory authority after consideration of soils, climate, the method of operation, geology, and other regional characteristics, shall meet the following performance standards.\"],\"scope_text\":\"Governed by steep slope operations under this section, where mining is not on flat/gently rolling terrain leaving a flat area and not governed by § 716.3.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1455,\"summary\":\"Woody materials may be chipped and distributed through the backfill when approved by the regulatory authority.\",\"target_ids\":[]}",
